  (text "Secondary leads are lettered on the sheet: blue 100 V line, white 16 ohm, yellow 8 ohm, orange common." (at 262 106 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "035dbd44-2897-45ed-a99e-d52ee356eb63"))
  (text "Feedback is taken from the 16 ohm tap." (at 262 110 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "7959eb43-92e4-43aa-842f-3f0235228ebf"))
  (text "Power — universal-primary mains transformer (110/250 V, 50/60 c/s) and a centre-tapped HT winding; each arm rectified by three series silicon diodes; reservoir of three series 32 uF pairs;" (at 20 208 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "de1db770-c4c9-40d0-86b8-cbc5beab45fa"))
  (text "a 20 H choke to the KT66 screen node, then 8.2 k and 10 k rail droppers. The mains lead carries a 2 A slow-blow fuse and the HT centre tap a 1 A slow-blow; a standby switch sits between" (at 20 212.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "bf93d2ed-5391-4e5c-a32a-86ba58c8bacb"))
  (text "the diode bank and the reservoir. Fuses, switch, mains transformer, heater winding and pilot lamp are omitted here — see netlist.cir." (at 20 217 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "1f0bedcc-220c-4e52-83f0-c299945dc7e3"))
